 "remarks": "Welcome to this spacious and beautifully maintained three-bedroom, two-bathroom corner loft unit. Ideally located in the heart of Stamford this open and inviting layout has been freshly painted, features engineered wood flooring throughout, and built-ins in all the closets. The kitchen offers newly painted cabinets, new countertops and stainless-steel appliances-including brand new refrigerator and microwave. Primary bedroom has an ensuite bathroom with double sinks and new counter tops. Full size washer and dryer in unit. Additional loft and bonus room complete this unit. Bonus room would make a great office or possibly fourth bedroom. The unit has two parking spaces in covered garage, one is assigned and one is a unassigned. A gym and courtyard with grills and picnic tables complete this wonderful building.  Enjoy the convenience of being within walking distance to downtown Stamford, with its vibrant restaurants, shopping, entertainment, and transportation. Mill River Park offers beautiful green space, walking paths, and recreational activities. Stamford Hospital is within easy walking distance.",
